# .claude: private by default (settings, worktrees, prose) — but project-
# authored skills are part of the toolchain and ship with the repo. The
# seeded ADD runtime skills stay local (upstream: 6digit-skills; re-seed
# with arbiters-init / arbiters-reconcile), same convention as koru.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/arbiters/
.claude/skills/arbiters-challenge/
.claude/skills/arbiters-worldmodel/
.claude/skills/membrane/
.claude/skills/bettermaker/
.claude/skills/flash/

